  m_Text: "B\u1EA5m c\xE1c n\xFAt hi\u1EC7n tr\xEAn m\xE0n h\xECnh \u0111\u1EC3 di
    chuy\u1EC3n. C\u1EA7n ho\xE0n th\xE0nh t\u1ED5 h\u1EE3p 3 ph\xEDm \u0111\u1EC3
